{"3479140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zen Aquarium", "steam_appid": 3479140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of <strong>serene underwater beauty</strong> with <i>Zen Aquarium</i>, the ultimate <strong>idle fish tank experience</strong> inspired by classic aquarium screensavers. No complex setups, no management stress, just <strong>pure visual enjoyment</strong> as a thriving aquatic world unfolds before your eyes. Perfect for ASMR lovers, chill gamers, and anyone who wants a peaceful, living desktop companion.<br><br><strong>❗ Disclaimer: Zen Aquarium does not support ultrawide resolutions (21:9, 32:9)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐠 Watch Your Aquarium Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New fish spawn and gracefully swim through your tank at regular intervals, creating an ever-evolving scene of <strong>harmony and tranquility</strong>. With <strong>simple and</strong> <strong>unique aquarium setups</strong> and <strong>many mesmerizing fish species</strong>, no two moments are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌊 The Ultimate Zen &amp; ASMR Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>relaxation and mindfulness</strong>, <i>Zen</i> <i>Aquarium </i> offers a <strong>soothing escape</strong> from the noise of everyday life. Let the gentle motion of fish, the soft bubbling of water, and the ambient aquatic sounds create a <strong>perfect stress-free atmosphere</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐟 Endless Combinations, Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your perfect aquatic atmosphere with a <strong>wide selection</strong> of ambient sounds and calming music. Whether you prefer gentle rainfall, soft wind, or even cozy cat purring, <i>Zen Aquarium</i> gives you full control. Mix and layer audio to create a <strong>unique soundscape</strong> that suits your mood—ideal for subtle background ambiance or full sensory immersion. Every session is a chance to discover a new combination, making each visit to your aquarium uniquely relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌿 No Stress, Just Serenity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional aquarium sims, <i>Zen Aquarium </i>is all about <strong>relaxation, not management</strong>. There’s no need to feed fish, clean tanks, or adjust water levels—just <strong>sit back, unwind, and enjoy the mesmerizing world beneath the surface</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of <strong>serene underwater beauty</strong> with <i>Zen Aquarium</i>, the ultimate <strong>idle fish tank experience</strong> inspired by classic aquarium screensavers. No complex setups, no management stress, just <strong>pure visual enjoyment</strong> as a thriving aquatic world unfolds before your eyes. Perfect for ASMR lovers, chill gamers, and anyone who wants a peaceful, living desktop companion.<br><br><strong>❗ Disclaimer: Zen Aquarium does not support ultrawide resolutions (21:9, 32:9)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐠 Watch Your Aquarium Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New fish spawn and gracefully swim through your tank at regular intervals, creating an ever-evolving scene of <strong>harmony and tranquility</strong>. With <strong>simple and</strong> <strong>unique aquarium setups</strong> and <strong>many mesmerizing fish species</strong>, no two moments are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/052bbc1de14d67c99782dec6ae7b59c2.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌊 The Ultimate Zen &amp; ASMR Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>relaxation and mindfulness</strong>, <i>Zen</i> <i>Aquarium </i> offers a <strong>soothing escape</strong> from the noise of everyday life. Let the gentle motion of fish, the soft bubbling of water, and the ambient aquatic sounds create a <strong>perfect stress-free atmosphere</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/10b2f1684634acf3614a9a722cc3615b.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐟 Endless Combinations, Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your perfect aquatic atmosphere with a <strong>wide selection</strong> of ambient sounds and calming music. Whether you prefer gentle rainfall, soft wind, or even cozy cat purring, <i>Zen Aquarium</i> gives you full control. Mix and layer audio to create a <strong>unique soundscape</strong> that suits your mood—ideal for subtle background ambiance or full sensory immersion. Every session is a chance to discover a new combination, making each visit to your aquarium uniquely relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.poster.avif?t=1775837593\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.webm?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/extras/21ad0c30e7cb1124da8a971c7efff048.mp4?t=1775837593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌿 No Stress, Just Serenity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional aquarium sims, <i>Zen Aquarium </i>is all about <strong>relaxation, not management</strong>. There’s no need to feed fish, clean tanks, or adjust water levels—just <strong>sit back, unwind, and enjoy the mesmerizing world beneath the surface</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the ultimate relaxing aquarium experience. Watch fish glide gracefully through a serene, ever-changing tank—no setup, no stress, just pure tranquility. Enjoy soothing visuals and ambient ASMR sounds as your aquarium comes to life effortlessly. Your peaceful escape awaits!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/e7a7c6d9472925227d65b2050cd42177a325a14c/header.jpg?t=1775837593", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/36dd314c0f069d4c3f502be99bdf0dba6ae627de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775837593", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479140/36dd314c0f069d4c3f502be99bdf0dba6ae627de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775837593", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong